WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:10.670
The panicked, worried, 'Do we need to get
out?', because I'd been checking Facebook

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:15.090
and there was lots of messages sitting there
saying, 'You know, is it a tsunami risk?'

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:17.200
and 'Do I actually need to get out?'

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.820
'Am I actually safe here?'

00:00:19.859 --> 00:00:24.700
I was getting my car ready, just putting the
emergency stuff in the car, getting the dog

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:28.000
ready and then the sirens went, and we were
like, we might as well just go.

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:30.940
They were very, very loud here.

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:35.719
That night I guess, it was absolutely still and
the sound carried for ages, and I think maybe

00:00:35.719 --> 00:00:37.939
that panicked a lot of people.

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:43.120
Definitely need to have them happen.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:44.550
People didn't really know what to do.

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:55.540
We're close to the coast, but are we that
close that we need to get out?

